{"channelId":"UCqRsGpMQKrz6dmA9yOkLSGw","row":["Cardiff University School of Healthcare Sciences",621,"We are dynamic, innovative and forward looking. We are recognised for our excellence in learning, teaching and research.\n\nWe are committed to the development of impactful healthcare knowledge that directly improves health outcomes and healthcare for patients and families. Our activities encompass a broad range of healthcare sciences including: Midwifery, Nursing (Adult, Child and Mental Health), Occupational Therapy, Physiotherapy, and Radiography (diagnostic and therapeutic).\n\nWe pride ourselves on pursuing research and scholarship of the highest quality, and we are one of the leading healthcare research departments in the UK. Our unique, multidisciplinary nature provides a rounded experience for our students, ensuring they become skilled, knowledgeable and compassionate healthcare professionals committed to an ethos of evidence-based care.\n\nhttp://www.cardiff.ac.uk/healthcare-sciences","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqRsGpMQKrz6dmA9yOkLSGw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqRsGpMQKrz6dmA9yOkLSGw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:53.052Z","channelId":"UCqRsGpMQKrz6dmA9yOkLSGw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"4483fc283e60ef7124c4d020ffdca20ad7de2b574003ab892bdfda7dcf96584f","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"97c559bcc18710bf171c2cd439d8fa0e4974516d32f9d9223cda854fca642024"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqRsGpMQKrz6dmA9yOkLSGw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:53.052Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqRsGpMQKrz6dmA9yOkLSGw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":621,"raw":"621 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqRsGpMQKrz6dmA9yOkLSGw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:53.052Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeyw